{"id":"bcd7bbad4b927831","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition.md","title":"固定字母表二部博弈的并行重复衰减","display":"thm-raz-parallel-repetition — 固定字母表二部博弈的并行重复衰减","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition","aliases":["28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition"],"display":"thm-raz-parallel-repetition — 固定字母表二部博弈的并行重复衰减","depends_on":["[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]"],"source_book_location":"§22.3.1; discussion supporting Theorem 22.15","source_printed_pages":"473–474","source_pdf_pages":"499–500","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-raz-parallel-repetition — 固定字母表二部博弈的并行重复衰减"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14d1529c46c2f8f2\" href=\"?note=14d1529c46c2f8f2\" title=\"28-df-parallel-repetition\">28-df-parallel-repetition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§22.3.1; discussion supporting Theorem 22.15"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"473–474"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"499–500"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[W]=\\{1,\\ldots,W\\}\">\\([W]=\\{1,\\ldots,W\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W\">\\(\\operatorname{BiGame}_W\\)</span> 是下式定义的合法二部博弈谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)\">\\(\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(P_e)_{e\\in E}\">\\(P=(P_e)_{e\\in E}\\)</span> 是边约束族，左右顶点按所属侧区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V,E\">\\(U,V,E\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,P\">\\(s,t,P\\)</span> 为函数候选。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^{*k}\">\\(\\Phi^{*k}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14d1529c46c2f8f2\" href=\"?note=14d1529c46c2f8f2\" title=\"28-df-parallel-repetition\">28-df-parallel-repetition</a> 及其上游的有限二部博弈接口，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\)</span> 成立时使用；边均匀抽样。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，重复博弈的整数标签字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[W^k]\">\\([W^k]\\)</span>，编解码使用上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_k,\\operatorname{dec}_k\">\\(\\beta_k,\\operatorname{dec}_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\nu\\in(0,1)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists U,V,E,s,t,P\\;\\left[\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)\\land|U|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land0&lt;|E|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land s\\in U^E\\land t\\in V^E\\land P\\in\\left(\\{0,1\\}^{[W]^2}\\right)^E\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists U,V,E,s,t,P\\;\\left[\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)\\land|U|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|V|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land0&lt;|E|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land s\\in U^E\\land t\\in V^E\\land P\\in\\left(\\{0,1\\}^{[W]^2}\\right)^E\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\forall\\nu\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists c\\in(0,1]\\;\\forall\\Phi\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Rightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\le\\nu\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\le\\nu^{ck}\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\forall\\nu\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists c\\in(0,1]\\;\\forall\\Phi\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Rightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\le\\nu\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\le\\nu^{ck}\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>合法博弈谓词把被量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 与同一量词范围内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 绑定，并排除空边集，使博弈值和重复构造均有定义。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 先于所有合法博弈及重复次数选取，因而只可依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,\\nu\">\\(W,\\nu\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原文解释固定常数 gap 下重复值至多 ν^{ct}，c 随字母表而变。本项谨慎显式允许 c 依赖固定 ν 和 W，未声称 gap 趋零时的统一最优率。原书不提供完整 Raz 证明；本次仅核对该衰减陈述，不作为已核验证明依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§22.3.1; discussion supporting Theorem 22.15；印刷页 473–474；PDF 页 499–500。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-parallel-repetition","status":"resolved","id":"14d1529c46c2f8f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-parallel-repetition","status":"resolved","id":"14d1529c46c2f8f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$[W]=\\{1,\\ldots,W\\}$。$\\operatorname{BiGame}_W$ 是下式定义的合法二部博弈谓词；$\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)$ 中 $P=(P_e)_{e\\in E}$ 是边约束族，左右顶点按所属侧区分。$U,V,E$ 为集合，$s,t,P$ 为函数候选。\n$\\Phi^{*k}$、$\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}$ 采用 [[28-df-parallel-repetition]] 及其上游的有限二部博弈接口，仅在 $\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)$ 成立时使用；边均匀抽样。对 $k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，重复博弈的整数标签字母表为 $[W^k]$，编解码使用上游的 $\\beta_k,\\operatorname{dec}_k$；$\\nu\\in(0,1)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"[W]=\\{1,\\ldots,W\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)","display":false},{"tex":"P=(P_e)_{e\\in E}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V,E","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,P","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^{*k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[W^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_k,\\operatorname{dec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists U,V,E,s,t,P\\;\\left[\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)\\land|U|<\\aleph_0\\land|V|<\\aleph_0\\land0<|E|<\\aleph_0\\land s\\in U^E\\land t\\in V^E\\land P\\in\\left(\\{0,1\\}^{[W]^2}\\right)^E\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\forall\\nu\\in(0,1)\\;\\exists c\\in(0,1]\\;\\forall\\Phi\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)\\Rightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\le\\nu\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\le\\nu^{ck}\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"W,\\nu","display":false}],"bytes":2578,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-401","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":["14d1529c46c2f8f2"]}